This repository contains materials that fall under two distinct licenses.

1. Hardware design files (all contents of '/hardware' and sub-folders) are
   provided under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 – Permissive
   (SPDX short identifier: CERN-OHL-P-2.0).

