   '/software', '/scripts' and other directories unless otherwise noted) are
   provided under the MIT License (SPDX short identifier: MIT).

You may use the hardware, the software, or both – provided you respect the
terms that apply to the corresponding part.

Where the term “Covered Source” appears in the CERN-OHL licence below, it
refers exclusively to the hardware design files of this project.

